-- Hand-written: T7 (08-C RB-37): the personal details of a never-accepted proposal or estimate are erased once, with its child rows; a redacted offer takes no PDF, view or decision, generated by scripts/write-triggers.ts from src/triggers.ts.
DROP TRIGGER `documents_frozen_update`;
